# Lanhouse: the page at the root of its own origin, https://play.ra.lanhouse.app/ (one Cloudflare R2 bucket per
# game behind Cloudflare, T-2450), the relay on the games VM behind the bunker's Caddy
# (wss://<games host>/<game>/<server slug>/<port name>, 612 modules/bunker/HOSTING.md 1.2). Names are provisional:
# change them here (or override any line from the environment) and rebuild. Where the page is served is not part
# of the build: it finds its files relative to itself, so the same build works at the root or under a path, and
# publish.json lists keys relative to wherever it is published. The relay must allow the page's origin
# (-origins https://play.ra.lanhouse.app -master-cors).
# Build: WEBRA_TARGET=lanhouse WEBRA_AOT=1 ./build-web.sh

# The relay is a bunker server with one websocket port, "ws" (path /, bunker/webra-relay/bunker.toml of
# lanhouse-playra/server, docs/bunker-servers.md): the host's Caddy strips /openra/relay/ws and passes the rest.
# Game connections: the port itself.
WEBRA_PROXY_URL=wss://games.lanhouse.app/openra/relay/ws
# versioncheck and gamenews: the relay's /master/ routes under the same port.
WEBRA_MASTER_RELAY=https://games.lanhouse.app/openra/relay/ws/master
# The Red Alert content package from our own site: https://play.ra.lanhouse.app/content/ra-quickinstall.<sha1>.zip, written by
# tools/fetch-content.py and uploaded with the build. The relay's content route is not used.
WEBRA_CONTENT_URL=content
# R2 cannot send headers; the policy is in the page too (Cloudflare adds the header and frame-ancestors).
WEBRA_META_CSP=1
WEBRA_PUBLISH_ENCODING=br
# The browser tab's title: the site's name first.
WEBRA_PAGE_TITLE=lanhouse.app - OpenRA
# The start screen before the game (hosting/lanhouse-splash.html, pt-BR). Its logo, hosting/lanhouse-logo.svg, is
# the lit sign of the brand files, brand/lanhouse-glow.svg of the lanhouse site (published at
# https://lanhouse.app/brand/), copied byte for byte: dark grounds only, never under 320 px wide, the whole image is
# its clear space (brand/README.md). To change it, copy the new file over it (or a .png in its place) and rebuild.
WEBRA_SPLASH=lanhouse
# The repository the start screen's "Código-fonte" link points into: <url>/tree/<the build's commit>.
WEBRA_SOURCE_URL=https://github.com/lanhouse-playra/game
